ine","info":"Removed endpoint: Trader's current order.","model":"Copy Trade","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-05-28","path":"/openApi/copyTrading/v1/swap/trace/closeTrackOrder","type":"Offline","info":"Removed endpoint: Traders close positions according to the order number.","model":"Copy Trade","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-03-19","path":"/openApi/swap/v2/quote/premiumIndex","type":"Update","info":"Added response fields to Mark Price and Funding Rate endpoint: fundingIntervalHours, minFundingRate, maxFundingRate, and updateTime; also refined field descriptions (fundingIntervalHours enum: 1/2/4/8, minFundingRate and maxFundingRate are decimal percentages, updateTime is a Unix timestamp in milliseconds).","model":"USDT-M Perpetual Contracts","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-02-25","path":"/openApi/spot/v2/market/kline","type":"Update","info":"Added timeZone parameter to the Kline/Candlestick Data endpoint; only 0 or 8 supported (UTC+0/UTC+8).","model":"Spot Trading","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-02-25","path":"/openApi/swap/v3/quote/klines","type":"Update","info":"Added timeZone parameter to the Kline/Candlestick Data endpoint; only 0 or 8 supported (UTC+0/UTC+8).","model":"USDT-M Perpetual Contracts","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-02-25","path":"/openApi/cswap/v1/market/klines","type":"Update","info":"Added timeZone parameter to the Kline/Candlestick Data endpoint; only 0 or 8 supported (UTC+0/UTC+8).","model":"Coin-M Perp Futures","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-01-22","path":"/openApi/swap/v2/quote/contracts","type":"Update","info":"OpenAPI now supports TradFi (non-crypto) trading pairs. Trading pairs with TradFi or non-crypto identifiers can be retrieved via the /openApi/swap/v2/quote/contracts endpoint.","model":"USDT-M Perpetual Contracts","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-01-05","path":"","type":"Update","info":"The rate limit policy for Market Data APIs has been updated to a unified standard. All market-related endpoints are now limited to a maximum of 500 requests per 10 seconds.","model":"Market Data","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-01-05","path":"/openApi/account/transfer/v1/subAccount/transferAsset","type":"Update","info":"A new account type value (15: Spot Account) has been added to fromAccountType and toAccountType. The supported account types now include: 1 – Fund Account; 2 – Standard Futures Account; 3 – Perpetual USDT-M Account; 15 – Spot Account.","model":"Wallet & Account","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-01-05","path":"/openApi/spot/v1/common/symbols","type":"Update","info":"A new status value (29: Pre-Delisted) has been added to the symbol list API. When a symbol is in Pre-Delisted (29) or Delisted (30) status, order placement requests will be blocked by the API service, while order cancellation is still allowed.","model":"Spot Trading","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-01-05","path":"/openApi/swap/v2/trade/order","type":"Update","info":"Added order-by-quote functionality with the field quoteOrderQty.","model":"USDT-M Perpetual Contracts","link":""},{"updateTime":"2025-12-18","path":"/openApi/swap/v2/trade/getVst","type":"Upgraded","info":"Upgraded the futures demo VST claim endpoint from v1 to v2, adding support for increasing or decreasing custom amounts.","model":"Swap Trading","link":"#/en/Swap/Trades%20Endpoints/Apply%20VST"},{"updateTime":"2025-12-16","path":"-","type":"Update","info":"Removed IP rate limits for Account API Group [2] and Group [3]. The previous IP-based limits, including the total group limit (2000 requests per 10 seconds) and the per-endpoint limit (300 requests per 10 seconds), are no longer applied.","model":"API","link":""},{"updateTime":"2025-12-09","path":"/openApi/account/transfer/v1/subAccount/transferAsset","type":"Added","info":"Added the Sub-Mother Account Asset Transfer interface. This interface is only available to the parent account and is used for asset transfers between the parent account and sub-accounts.","model":"Sub-account Management","link":"#/en/Account%20&%20Wallet/Sub-ac