module.exports = {"type":"REST","title":"測試下單","en":"Test Order","api":{"uri":"/openApi/swap/v2/trade/order/test","method":"POST","rate-limitation":"5/second","ip-rate-limitation":"2","payload":{"symbol":"BTC-USDT","side":"BUY","positionSide":"LONG","type":"MARKET","quantity":5,"takeProfit":"{\"type\": \"TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET\", \"stopPrice\": 31968.0,\"price\": 31968.0,\"workingType\":\"MARK_PRICE\"}"},"responseBody":{"code":0,"msg":"","data":{"order":{"symbol":"BTC-USDT","orderId":1735950529123455000,"side":"BUY","positionSide":"LONG","type":"MARKET","clientOrderId":"","workingType":"MARK_PRICE"}}},"request":{"info":["<div>基於訂單 type 不同，強制要求某些參數:</div>","<div><li>LIMIT: 強制要求參數 quantity, price</li></div>","<div><li>MARKET: 強制要求參數 quantity</li></div>","<div><li>TRAILING_STOP_MARKET（追跡委託單）和TRAILING_TP_SL（移動止盈止損單）：需填寫price欄位或者priceRate欄位</li></div>","<div><li>TRIGGER_LIMIT, STOP, TAKE_PROFIT: 強制要求參數 quantity、stopPrice、price</li></div>","<div><li>STOP_MARKET, TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET, TRIGGER_MARKET: 強制要求參數 quantity、stopPrice</li></div>","<div><li>當 closePosition=true 時，STOP_MARKET 和 TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET 仍必須傳 quantity 和 stopPrice</li></div>","<div><li>雙向持倉（Hedge Mode）不得傳 reduceOnly；普通雙向持倉模式不要求 positionId，僅逐倉分倉模式平倉時必須傳 positionId</li></div>","<div>條件單的觸發必須:</div>","<div><h3>STOP/STOP_MARKET 止損單:</h3></div>","<div><li>已掛止損單累加數量不能大於持倉數量</li></div>","<div><li>買入: 標記價格高於等於觸發價stopPrice</li></div>","<div><li>賣出: 標記價格低於等於觸發價stopPrice</li></div>","<div><h3>TAKE_PROFIT/TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET 止盈單:</h3></div>","<div><li>已掛止盈單累加數量不能大於持倉數量</li></div>","<div><li>買入: 標記價格低於等於觸發價stopPrice</li></div>","<div><li>賣出: 標記價格高於等於觸發價stopPrice</li></div>","<div>最小下單數量可從接口 /openApi/swap/v2/quote/contracts 獲取:tradeMinQuantity、tradeMinUSDT</div>","<div><b>交易規則:</b></div>","<div><a href='https://bingx.com/zh-tw/tradeInfo/perpetual/trading-rules/BTC-USDT/' target='_blank'>https://bingx.com/zh-tw/tradeInfo/perpetual/trading-rules/BTC-USDT/</a></div>","<div>關於價格精度和數量精度參考接口: <a href='https://open-api.bingx.com/openApi/swap/v2/quote/contracts' target='_blank'>https://open-api.bingx.com/openApi/swap/v2/quote/contracts</a></div>","<div>如果精度超過當期的範圍，當前API下單仍然成功，但是會被截斷.比如price要求是:0.0001,如果下單0.123456.最後會以0.1234成功提交</div>"],"info_en":["<div>The participation and return are consistent with the ordering interface, but the actual order will not be placed, only the test results will be returned. The result is a fake order, and your funds will not be deducted. It will not appear on the real transaction panel and is only used to help you practice using the order interface</div>","<div>Depending on the order type, certain parameters are mandatory:</div>","<div><li>LIMIT: Mandatory Parameters: quantity, price</li></div>","<div><li>MARKET: Mandatory Parameters: quantity</li></div>","<div><li>TRAILING_STOP_MARKET (Tracking Stop Loss Order) or TRAILING_TP_SL (Trailing TakeProfit/StopLoss Order): The price field or priceRate field needs to be filled in</li></div>","<div><li>TRIGGER_LIMIT, STOP, TAKE_PROFIT: Mandatory Parameters: quantity, stopPrice, price</li></div>","<div><li>STOP_MARKET, TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET, TRIGGER_MARKET: Mandatory Parameters: quantity, stopPrice</li></div>","<div><li>When closePosition=true, quantity and stopPrice are still mandatory for STOP_MARKET and TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET</li></div>","<div><li>Do not send reduceOnly in Hedge Mode. positionId is not required in regular Hedge Mode; it is mandatory only when closing a position in Separate Isolated mode</li></div>","<div>The triggering of the conditional order must:</div>","<div><h3>STOP/STOP_MARKET stop loss order:</h3></div>","<div><li>The accumulative quantity of the pending stop loss orders cannot be greater than the quantity of open positions</li></div>","<div><li>Buy: the mark price is higher than or equal to the trigger price stopPrice</li></div>","<div><li>Sell: the mark price is lower than or equal to the trigger price stopPrice</li></div>","<div><h3>TAKE_PROFIT/TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET take profit order:</h3></div>","<div><li>The accumulative quantity of the pending take profit order cannot be greater than the position quantity</li></div>","<div><li>Buy: the mark price is lower than or equal to the trigger price stopPrice</li></div>","<div><li>Sell: the mark price is higher than or equal to the trigger price stopPrice</li></div>","<div>The minimum order quantity can be obtained from the api /openApi/swap/v2/quote/contracts: tradeMinQuantity, tradeMinUSDT</div>","<div><b>Trading Rules:</b></div>","<div><a href='https://bingx.com/en/tradeInfo/perpetual/trading-rules/BTC-USDT/' target='_blank'>https://bingx.com/en/tradeInfo/perpetual/trading-rules/BTC-USDT/</a></div>","<div>About price accuracy and quantity accuracy reference interface: <a href='https://open-api.bingx.com/openApi/swap/v2/quote/contracts' target='_blank'>https://open-api.bingx.com/openApi/swap/v2/quote/contracts</a></div>","<div>If the accuracy exceeds the range of the current period, the current API order will still be successful, but it will be truncated. For example, the price requirement is: 0.0001, if the order is 0.123456, it will be successfully submitted with 0.1234.</div>"],"list":[{"name":"symbol","type":"string","required_zh":"是","required_en":"Yes","values":"","zh":"交易對, 例如: BTC-USDT, 請使用大寫字母","en":"There must be a hyphen/ \"-\" in the trading pair symbol. eg: BTC-USDT"},{"name":"type","type":"string","required_zh":"是","required_en":"Yes","values":"","zh":"LIMIT：限價單/MARKET：市價單/STOP_MARKET：市價止損單/TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET：市價止盈單/STOP：限價止損單/TAKE_PROFIT：限價止盈單/TRIGGER_LIMIT：計劃委託單限價單/TRIGGER_MARKET：計劃委託市價單/TRAILING_STOP_MARKET:追蹤委託單/TRAILING_TP_SL:移動止盈止損","en":"LIMIT: Limit Order / MARKET: Market Order / STOP_MARKET: Stop Market Order / TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET: Take Profit Market Order / STOP: Stop Limit Order / TAKE_PROFIT: Take Profit Limit Order / TRIGGER_LIMIT: Stop Limit Order with Trigger / TRIGGER_MARKET: Stop Market Order with Trigger / TRAILING_STOP_MARKET: Trailing Stop Market Order / TRAILING_TP_SL: Trailing TakeProfit or StopLoss"},{"name":"side","type":"string","required_zh":"是","required_en":"Yes","values":"","zh":"買賣方向 SELL, BUY","en":"buying and selling direction SELL, BUY"},{"name":"positionSide","type":"string","required_zh":"否","required_en":"No","values":"","zh":"持倉方向，單項持倉必填BOTH，雙向持倉僅可選擇 LONG 或 SHORT，為空時默認LONG","en":"Position direction, required for single position as BOTH, for both long and short positions only LONG or SHORT can be chosen, defaults to LONG if empty"},{"name":"reduceOnly","type":"string","required_zh":"否","required_en":"No","values":"","zh":"true, false；單向持倉模式下默認 false；雙向持倉（Hedge Mode）不得傳此參數","en":"true, false; defaults to false in One-way Mode; do not send this parameter in Hedge Mode"},{"name":"price","type":"float64","required_zh":"否","required_en":"No","values":"","zh":"委託價格，TRAILING_STOP_MARKET和TRAILING_TP_SL類型傳該參數表示回撤價差","en":"Price, represents the trailing stop distance in TRAILING_STOP_MARKET and TRAILING_TP_SL"},{"name":"quantity","type":"float64","required_zh":"否","required_en":"No","values":"","zh":"下單數量，合約數量。當前只支持以幣計的合約數，暫不支持用 U 的數量下單。STOP_MARKET 和 TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET 即使 closePosition=true 也必須傳此參數","en":"Order quantity in contract coin units. Ordering by quote currency amount is not currently supported. This parameter is mandatory for STOP_MARKET and TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET even when closePosition=true."},{"name":"stopPrice","type":"float64","required_zh":"否","required_en":"No","values":"","zh":"觸發價, 僅 STOP_MARKET,TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET,STOP,TAKE_PROFIT,TRIGGER_LIMIT,TRIGGER_MARKET 需要此參數","en":"Trigger price, only required for STOP_MARKET, TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET, STOP, TAKE_PROFIT, TRIGGER_LIMIT, TRIGGER_MARKET"},{"name":"priceRate","type":"float64","required_zh":"否","required_en":"No","values":"","zh":"針對type:TRAILING_STOP_MARKET和TRAILING_TP_SL； 最大：1","en":"For type: TRAILING_STOP_MARKET or TRAILING_TP_SL; Maximum: 1"},{"name":"timestamp","type":"int64","required_zh":"是","required_en":"Yes","values":"","zh":"請求的時間戳，單位:毫秒","en":"request timestamp, unit: millisecond"},{"name":"stopLoss","type":"string","required_zh":"否","required_en":"No","values":"","zh":"支持下單同時設置止損。但僅支持type: STOP_MARKET/STOP","en":"Support setting stop loss while placing an order. Only supports type: STOP_MARKET/STOP"},{"name":"takeProfit","type":"string","required_zh":"否","required_en":"No","values":"","zh":"支持下單同時設置止盈。但僅支持type: TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET/TAKE_PROFIT","en":"Support setting take profit while placing an order. Only supports type: TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET/TAKE_PROFIT"},{"name":"clientOrderId","type":"string","required_zh":"否","required_en":"No","values":"","zh":"用戶自定義訂單ID，限制字符長度1-40,不同訂單不可使用相同的clientOrderId","en":"Customized order ID for users, with a limit of characters from 1 to 40. Different orders cannot use the same clientOrderId"},{"name":"recvWindow","type":"int64","required_zh":"否","required_en":"No","values":"","zh":"請求有效時間空窗值, 單位:毫秒","en":"Request valid time window value, Unit: milliseconds"},{"name":"timeInForce","type":"string","required_zh":"否","required_en":"No","values":"","zh":"有效方式，目前支持PostOnly、GTC、IOC和FOK","en":"Time in Force, currently supports PostOnly, GTC, IOC, and FOK"},{"name":"closePosition","type":"string","required_zh":"否","required_en":"No","values":"","zh":"true, false；觸發後全部平倉，僅支援 STOP_MARKET 和 TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET。即使設為 true，當前接口仍要求傳 quantity 和 stopPrice。自帶只平倉效果，不與 reduceOnly 合用","en":"true, false; closes the entire position after triggering and supports only STOP_MARKET and TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET. Even when set to true, the current endpoint still requires quantity and stopPrice. It has a reduce-only effect and must not be used with reduceOnly."},{"name":"activationPrice","type":"float64","required_zh":"否","required_en":"No","values":"","zh":"追蹤委託單/移動止盈止損單啟動價格，TRAILING_TP_SL和TRAILING_STOP_MARKET 需要此參數, 預設為下單當前市場價格(支援不同workingType)","en":"Used with TRAILING_STOP_MARKET or TRAILING_TP_SL orders, default as the latest price(supporting different workingType)"},{"name":"positionId","type":"int64","required_zh":"否","required_en":"No","values":"","zh":"普通雙向持倉模式下無需傳入；僅逐倉分倉模式平倉時必傳","en":"Not required in regular Hedge Mode. Required only when closing a position in Separate Isolated mode."}]},"response":{"info":"","info_en":"","list":[{"name":"symbol","type":"string","values":"","zh":"交易對, 例如: BTC-USDT","en":"trading pair, for example: BTC-USDT"},{"name":"side","type":"string","values":"","zh":"買賣方向","en":"buying and selling direction"},{"name":"type","type":"string","values":"","zh":"LIMIT：限價單/MARKET：市價單/STOP_MARKET：市價止損單/TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET：市價止盈單/STOP：限價止損單/TAKE_PROFIT：限價止盈單/TRIGGER_LIMIT：計劃委託單限價單/TRIGGER_MARKET：計劃委託市價單/TRAILING_STOP_MARKET:追蹤委託單/TRAILING_TP_SL:移動止盈止損","en":"LIMIT: Limit Order / MARKET: Market Order / STOP_MARKET: Stop Market Order / TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET: Take Profit Market Order / STOP: Stop Limit Order / TAKE_PROFIT: Take Profit Limit Order / TRIGGER_LIMIT: Stop Limit Order with Trigger / TRIGGER_MARKET: Stop Market Order with Trigger / TRAILING_STOP_MARKET: Trailing Stop Market Order / TRAILING_TP_SL: Trailing TakeProfit or StopLoss"},{"name":"positionSide","type":"string","values":"","zh":"持倉方向，單項持倉必填BOTH，雙向持倉僅可選擇 LONG 或 SHORT，為空時默認LONG","en":"Position direction, required for single position as BOTH, for both long and short positions only LONG or SHORT can be chosen, defaults to LONG if empty"},{"name":"reduceOnly","type":"string","values":"","zh":"返回訂單是否為只減倉：true、false；雙向持倉（Hedge Mode）不使用此字段","en":"Whether the returned order is reduce-only: true or false. This field is not used in Hedge Mode."},{"name":"orderId","type":"int64","values":"","zh":"訂單號","en":"Order ID"},{"name":"clientOrderId","type":"string","values":"","zh":"用戶自定義訂單ID","en":"Customized order ID for users"}]},"error":{"info":"","info_en":"","list":[]}},"info":{"en":[{"type":"div","info":"Signature Verification: Yes"},{"type":"div","info":"Applicable Accounts: Master and Sub Accounts"},{"type":"div","info":"API Key Permission: Professional Futures Trading"},{"type":"div","info":"Endpoint description:The current account places an order on the specified symbol contract. (Supports limit order, market order, market order for plan entrustment, limit order for plan entrustment, position stop profit and stop loss order, and liquidation for positions)"},{"type":"div","info":"Error Codes: See <a href=\"#/en/Quick%20Start/Error%20Code%20Reference?anchor=cat-futures\" style=\"color:#409eff;\">Error Code Reference — Futures Error Codes</a>"}],"zh":[{"type":"div","info":"是否驗簽: 是"},{"type":"div","info":"適用帳戶: 子母帳戶"},{"type":"div","info":"API Key權限: 專業合約交易"},{"type":"div","info":"接口描述：當前賬戶在指定symbol合約上進行下單操作。(支持限價單、市價單、計劃委託市價單、計劃委託限價單、倉位止盈止損單、針對倉位平倉)"},{"type":"div","info":"錯誤碼：請參考 <a href=\"#/zh-tw/Quick%20Start/Error%20Code%20Reference?anchor=cat-futures\" style=\"color:#409eff;\">錯誤碼參考 — 合約錯誤碼</a>"}]}}


