 TAKE_PROFIT: Take Profit Limit Order / TRIGGER_LIMIT: Stop Limit Order with Trigger / TRIGGER_MARKET: Stop Market Order with Trigger / TRAILING_STOP_MARKET: Trailing Stop Market Order"},{"name":"positionSide","type":"string","values":"","zh":"持倉方向，單項持倉必填BOTH，雙向持倉僅可選擇 LONG 或 SHORT，為空時默認LONG","en":"Position direction, required for single position as BOTH, for both long and short positions only LONG or SHORT can be chosen, defaults to LONG if empty"},{"name":"reduceOnly","type":"string","values":"","zh":"true, false; 單項持倉模式下默認false；雙開持倉模式下不接受此參數","en":"true, false; Default value is false for single position mode; This parameter is not accepted for both long and short positions mode"},{"name":"cumQuote","type":"string","values":"","zh":"成交金額","en":"transaction amount"},{"name":"status","type":"string","values":"NEW/PENDING/FILLED/PARTIALLYFILLED/CANCELLED/FAILED","zh":"訂單狀態: NEW(新訂單)/PENDING(委託中)/FILLED(完全成交)/PARTIALLYFILLED(部分成交)/CANCELLED(已撤銷)/FAILED(失敗)","en":"Order status: NEW(New order)/PENDING(Pending)/FILLED(Filled)/PARTIALLYFILLED(Partially filled)/CANCELLED(Cancelled)/FAILED(Failed)"},{"name":"stopPrice","type":"string","values":"","zh":"觸發價","en":"Trigger price"},{"name":"price","type":"string","values":"","zh":"委託價格","en":"Price"},{"name":"origQty","type":"string","values":"","zh":"原始委託數量","en":"original order quantity"},{"name":"avgPrice","type":"string","values":"","zh":"平均成交價","en":"average transaction price"},{"name":"executedQty","type":"string","values":"","zh":"成交量","en":"volume"},{"name":"orderId","type":"int64","values":"","zh":"訂單號","en":"Order ID"},{"name":"profit","type":"string","values":"","zh":"盈虧","en":"profit and loss"},{"name":"commission","type":"string","values":"","zh":"手續費","en":"Fee"},{"name":"updateTime","type":"int64","values":"","zh":"更新時間,單位:毫秒","en":"StopPrice trigger price types: MARK_PRICE, CONTRACT_PRICE, INDEX_PRICE, default MARK_PRICE"},{"name":"workingType","type":"string","values":"","zh":"stopPrice觸發價價格類型：MARK_ PRICE、CONTRACT_ PRICE、INDEX_ PRICE，默認MARK_ PRICE","en":"update time, unit: millisecond"},{"name":"stopGuaranteed","type":"string","values":"","zh":"true：啟用保證止盈停損功能；false：不啟用保證停損功能。預設不啟用保證止盈止損功能。支援的訂單類型type有：STOP_MARKET：市價止損單/TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET：市價止盈單/STOP：限價止損單/TAKE_PROFIT：限價止盈單/TRIGGER_LIMIT：計劃委託單限價單/TRIGGER_MARKET：計劃計劃委託市價單。","en":"true: Enables the guaranteed stop-loss and take-profit feature; false: Disables the feature. The guaranteed stop-loss feature is not enabled by default. Supported order types include: STOP_MARKET: Market stop-loss order / TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET: Market take-profit order / STOP: Limit stop-loss order / TAKE_PROFIT: Limit take-profit order / TRIGGER_LIMIT: Stop-limit order with trigger / TRIGGER_MARKET: Market order with trigger for stop-loss."},{"name":"triggerOrderId","type":"int64","values":"","zh":"這一訂單關聯的觸發單訂單號","en":"trigger order ID associated with this order"},{"name":"isTwap","type":"bool","values":"","zh":"是否為TWAP訂單，true：是，flase：不是","en":"Whether it is a TWAP order, true: yes, false: no"},{"name":"mainOrderId","type":"string","values":"","zh":"TWAP委託訂單編號","en":"TWAP order number"}]},"error":{"info":"","info_en":"","list":[]}},"info":{"en":[{"type":"div","info":"Signature Verification: Yes"},{"type":"div","info":"Applicable Accounts: Master and Sub Accounts"},{"type":"div","info":"API Key Permission: Read"},{"type":"div","info":"Endpoint description:Query the user's historical orders (order status is completed or canceled).\n\n"},{"type":"div","info":"Error Codes: See <a href=\"#/en/Quick%20Start/Error%20Code%20Reference?anchor=cat-futures\" style=\"color:#409eff;\">Error Code Reference — Futures Error Codes</a>"}],"zh":[{"type":"div","info":"是否驗簽: 是"},{"type":"div","info":"適用帳戶: 子母帳戶"},{"type":"div","info":"API Key權限: 讀取"},{"type":"div","info":"接口描述：查詢用戶歷史訂單(訂單狀態為已成交或已撤銷)"},{"type":"div","info":"錯誤碼：請參考 <a href=\"#/zh-tw/Quick%20Start/Error%20Code%20Reference?anchor=cat-futures\" style=\"color:#409eff;\">錯誤碼參考 — 合約錯誤碼</a>"}]}}


